      "statement": "The graph module (Release 2, extended in Release 5) owns the research map: works grouped by work_key, citation links from saved Docling references (computed once per content and shared), a per-subject timeline, reading order (cited works before citing, then by year), and reading-path answers. Release 5 adds model-labeled relationships and concept history. Key classes: Work, WorkLink, ReadingOrder; service ResearchMapService. May use knowledge.application.",
